    "detailed_description": "This game is about a Girl and her dog in a glorious adventure about the ordinary task of cleaning up after your dog. <br><br>The game features : <br><br>\u2022Different locations you can clean up after your dog. In a park, in the snow, in the forest etc.<br><br>\u2022A recruitable dog who will auto-battle (if needed). Wow!!<br><br>\u2022Different Karens that yell at you for not cleaning up after your dog! Typical KAREN!<br><br>\u2022At least 10 different costumes / dresses to collect and wear!<br><br>\u2022Parallax Backgrounds, whatever that is! <br><br>\u2022A couple sound effects!<br><br>\u2022One Weapon. Whoa! <br><br>AND, OF COURSE<br><br>\u2022Traditional turn-based combat with new and clearly superior <strong>Retro Sideview Combat</strong>!",
